{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o040b","title":"徐晃从征吕布降赵庶李邹","accounts":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o040b-account","label":"《张乐于张徐传第十七》正文","text":"徐晃从征吕布降赵庶李邹","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0180","role":"征讨","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040b-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0030","role":"降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040b-q"]},{"person":"zhangle-p0031","role":"降","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"徐晃从曹操后","precision":"undated","basis":"保留本条时间表达，不据相邻段落自动补年。","evidence":["zhangle-e-o040b-q"]},"ordering_evidence":"zhangle-e-o040b-q","source_order":[17,146,"O040b"],"order":3573}],"persons":[{"id":"zhangle-p0030","name":"赵庶","evidence":["zhangle-q-o040"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhangle-m-o040-zhangle-p0030","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhangle-q-o040"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"zhangle-e-o040b-q","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-e7ed3fa863e93b8dd8f5","layer":"original","quote":"从征吕布，别降布将赵庶、李邹等。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":28,"end":44,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhangle-q-o040","section":"chapter-017","block":"b-e7ed3fa863e93b8dd8f5","layer":"original","quote":"太祖授晃兵，使击卷、﹝一﹞原武贼〖1〗；破之，拜裨将军。从征吕布，别降布将赵庶、李邹等。与史涣斩眭固于河内。从破刘备。又从破颜良，拔白马；进至延津，破文丑，拜偏将军。与曹洪击！强贼祝臂，破之。又与史涣击袁绍运车于故市〖2〗，功最多，封都亭侯〖3〗。太祖既围邺，破邯郸。易阳令韩范，伪以城降而拒守，太祖遣晃攻之。晃至，飞矢城中，为陈成败；范悔，晃辄降之〖4〗。既而言于太祖曰：“二袁未破，诸城未下者倾耳而听；今日灭易阳〖5〗，明日皆以死守：恐河北无定时也。愿公降易阳以示诸诚，则莫不望风。”太祖善之。别讨毛城，设伏兵掩击，破三屯。从破袁谭于南皮，讨平原叛贼，克之。从征蹋顿，拜横野将军〖6〗。","section_title":"张乐于张徐传第十七","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0039.xhtml","index":145,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":295,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
